# Final-review regression tests (src/venue/recovery-final.test.ts) — VR-28 (D1), VR-29 (D2), A-4 terminal-order eviction coverage.
# Pre-fix tree: a copy of the Milestone 10 working tree taken before these fixes (src only; scratch copy, node_modules linked).
#   cp src/venue/recovery-final.test.ts <pre-fix-copy>/src/venue/ && (cd <pre-fix-copy> && npx vitest run src/venue/recovery-final.test.ts)
# Expected before the fixes: 15 failures (11 VR-28, 4 VR-29). The 4 passing tests are not defect
# demonstrations: genuinely truncated tails and malformed lines with a newline were already handled, and the
# terminal-order eviction tests close a coverage gap (the engine's permanent client-id index already protected it).

